---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="How it works">
  <h1>How it works</h1>
  <p>
    The planned sender uses native WebCrypto to wrap a fresh AES-256 key with
    RSA-OAEP SHA-256, then encrypt exact UTF-8 message bytes with AES-GCM.
    Celestial glyphs present ciphertext reversibly; they do not add security.
  </p>
  <p>
    Send raw ciphertext with the artwork. Only the matching private key can
    normally decrypt it. Public-key encryption does not identify the sender.
  </p>
  <p>The application and independent security review are in development.</p>
</Layout>
